From eb2a43f38cba8ab355fbda8b17eb008466ff5c2e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: admin <vasiliy.cherniavskiy@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:37:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] security: a module registers facts, claims and their
 contracts only under its own name

AccessFact.owner_module, add_claims_contributor(owner=) and the reserved
contract families <m>.claims.v1 / <m>.facts.v1 are checked against the
module whose registration is being applied; another module's name, or a
registration outside a module's registration, refuses the load
(SANDLOOM-B034). Over RPC, a consumer drops a fact <m>.facts.v1 describes
under another owner_module.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
